### 上传文档（multipart/form-data，格式白名单与 50 MB 上限）
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/upload?knowledgeBaseId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="期末复习笔记.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./期末复习笔记.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### 分页查询文档（可按知识库、标题、状态收窄）
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&knowledgeBaseId=1&status=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取文档详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/get?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 重试入库（仅失败文档，回到「排队」重新执行）
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/retry?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除文档（软删除，30 天内可恢复）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/delete?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 恢复文档（恢复到删除前状态）
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/restore?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
